# Windows-only system-tray icon (satellite/tray.py). Markered so the shared
# tarball's venv only pulls these on Windows — the tray is imported lazily and
# guarded (maybe_start_tray returns None off-Windows / on ImportError), so a
# Linux/macOS install without them runs fully headless. pystray pulls `six`.
# From Python 3.11 only: Pillow 13 has no 3.10 build, and a Windows
# satellite on 3.10 runs without the tray rather than on an older Pillow
# with published vulnerabilities.
